@startuml Sequence Diagram - Payment Creation
title A - Creacion de Pago (pendiente + webhook)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam titleFontSize 11
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 10
skinparam ActorFontSize 10
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam NoteFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceGroupFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceDividerFontSize 10
skinparam maxMessageSize 90
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #666666

participant "Comercio" as Comercio
participant "KitPagos\n(Facade)" as Facade
participant "Adapter\n(seleccionado por\nGatewayFactory)" as Adapter
participant "Pasarela" as Pasarela

Comercio -> Facade : createPayment(request)
Facade -> Adapter : createPayment(request)
Adapter -> Pasarela : POST /payments (nativo)
Pasarela --> Adapter : 201 Created\n(estado nativo = pendiente, token)
Adapter -> Adapter : ResponseNormalizer.\nnormalize(\nrawResponse,\ngateway)
Adapter --> Facade : PaymentResult
Facade --> Comercio : PaymentResult(PENDING) o\nPaymentResult(\nREDIRECT_REQUIRED)

note over Comercio, Pasarela
  Este flujo NO entrega el resultado final del
  pago. La confirmacion (APROBADO, RECHAZADO,
  etc.) llega despues mediante un webhook: ver
  diagrama "Sequence Diagram - Webhook
  Conciliation".
end note

@enduml
